_Screenshot_03_2560x1440.png", "id": "688981123354563", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974507_688981126687896_6736655473577228057_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iyMb7oQoBAwQ7kNvwGTDdO8&_nc_oc=AdoM0jv_26RSB2QHJoTfJ77nB2Z4n_0nB4iHrn8wK4VMvKN5htyXg8q25dEF-jbD4Ew&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRfKncHbOrbA6v1Jieo7j6n38HV5pJn1k8Y2xc34RwAuQ&oe=6AF33656"}, {"file_name": "ZeroCaliber2_Screenshot_04_2560x1440.png", "id": "780519374202336", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001680_780519377535669_5621174576393243075_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kQYaaFulIQ0Q7kNvwEuh1It&_nc_oc=AdqdC-ED86dZyMt9EPOP0kwQ6j3-I0BFTscs9E_K1LySdUqvsg_nHY90N_cFnKA74qs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSVZiZ0Tu0Mfg8HBN51ZW5eQQxYAzKJLD9gIDUksNibCA&oe=6AF345C9"}, {"file_name": "ZeroCaliber2_Screenshot_05_2560x1440.png", "id": "2579849238870307", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031400_2579849242203640_4717901026076490611_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ny9EZ-zjM_UQ7kNvwF7NJTi&_nc_oc=AdodNE6USnEuDc2gkxVYcSNWxESvvp6iYgczujwCTWVLeb6x8rxVrV5qC7KMPOZJGKs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTfG5NvzjNvysyKrrUjGLx9pDf8nrV2QEt33l9JKrd_VQ&oe=6AF324E4"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Zc2_NewArt_Landscape.png", "id": "2962008947490451", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825462_2962008950823784_9117324633707168377_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pIzqR7EsX0IQ7kNvwFTXuni&_nc_oc=Adqo7iU1C-Sc5oCNqPcKV2vdQKGpOadM32jYP8sxbY7eIIo5Srkk7Pn7hjxsB7WnGsM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSRqvCGOo1JOsJ7lRTKFq152f0lQwoKx4xO1R3vjnnKLQ&oe=6AF32AE3"}, "display_name": "Zero Caliber 2", "keywords": ["coop", "shooter", "story", "military", "campaign"], "long_description": "\u2728 **Now with ENHANCED Quest 3/3S visuals and smoother gameplay!** \u2728\n\n# \ud83d\udd11 KEY FEATURES\n\nZero Caliber 2 is THE ultimate VR shooter package:\n\n- 8+ hour **solo campaign** fully playable in **Co-op** (up to 4 players)\n\n- Classic **multiplayer game modes** (up to 10 players)\n\n- Native **mod support**\n\n- **60+ unlockable weapons**, skins, and attachments\n\n- Gripping story full of cinematic action reminescent of classic FPS games\n\n{888829013066754}\n\n# \ud83d\udcd6 THE STORY\n\nIn a world where water is scarce, a ruthless dictator, Barak, and his fanatic followers threaten the fragile peace of the OSA. Their brutal invasion aims to control the vital WELL water supplies, putting millions at risk.\n\n{1153668505934186}\n\nAs a **skilled operative**, your task is to navigate a war-torn landscape and undertake high-stakes missions to reclaim the stolen WELL supplies. **Fight** through cities and remote villages, face ruthless enemies, and uncover a web of betrayal and chaos. **The fate of the OSA is in your hands** - fight to end Barak\u2019s reign of terror and secure humanity\u2019s future!\n\n{689968696629104}\n\n# \ud83d\udd2e WHAT'S NEXT?\n\nZero Caliber 2's release is only the beginning - help us shape the future of the Zero Caliber IP by joining our community and sharing your feedback/suggestions!\n\n\ud83d\udc49 https:// discord.gg/xrealgames \ud83d\udc48\n\nFor technical issues: support@xrealgames.com\n\n\u23af\u23af\u23af\u23af\u23af\n\nCheck out, and wishlist COVR, our new upcoming tactical shooter here: \nhttps://www.meta.com/experiences/covr/26564910626481959/ \n\n{1475791441029449}", "short_description": "8+ hour single player/Co-op campaign, cinematic action, explosions, 60+ weapons and skins to unlock, PvP, mods, airstrikes, all in one single package - this is Zero Caliber 2, the sequel to our critically acclaimed Zero Caliber: Reloaded military shooter. See you on the virtual battlefields! o7"}]}, "developer_name": "XREAL Games", "develo